# UDS (Unified Design System) — Cursor rules

Package: `@chghealthcare/unified-design-system`

**Canonical sources (read before generating UI):**
- [`ai/uds-contract.json`](./ai/uds-contract.json) — machine-readable contract (also `@chghealthcare/unified-design-system/contract` when installed)
- [`design-language/`](./design-language/) — Design System Language (why/when); start at `design-language/README.md`
- [`ai/indexes/`](./ai/indexes/) — AI retrieval indexes (concept, decision, pattern, reasoning, …)
- [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) — agent rules summary
- [`setup.md`](./setup.md) — consumer bootstrap
- [`AI_USAGE.md`](./AI_USAGE.md) — allowed imports and anti-patterns
- [`figma.component.rules.md`](./figma.component.rules.md) — Figma build/update rules

## Imports (consumers)

```tsx
import { AppShell, Button, Card, Menu } from "@chghealthcare/unified-design-system"
import "@chghealthcare/unified-design-system/styles.css"
```

**Do not** import from `src/components/ui/*`, `dist/*`, `@/*`, or `*-base` / `*-core` / `*-theme` / `*-uds` modules.

Legacy package `@mich8060/chg-design-system` and the old `src/ui/` folder layout are **not** this repo.

## Authenticated screens

- Default shell: **`AppShell`** with **`Menu`** in the menu slot (not `Sidebar*` unless you own rail CSS).
- Page content: **`AppShell.Main`**. Set **`enableRouterOutlet={false}`** for static apps.
- Branding + menu toggle live in the full-width **AppShell Header**; set **`brand`** / **`headerVariant`** / **`headerTitle`** on AppShell (Menu is nav-only). See `ai/guides/menu-header-identity.md`.
- Screen patterns: `design-language/decision-rules/choosing-patterns.md` → `ai/recipes/*.md` and `ai/examples/*.tsx`.
- Reason with `design-language/grammar/` and `design-language/decision-rules/trees/` before inventing layout.

## Styling

- Design tokens: CSS variables `--uds-*` (semantic colors, spacing, radius).
- Rectangle corner radius **≤ 12px**; `rounded-full` only for circles/pills.
- Icons: Phosphor via package icon components (e.g. `HouseIcon`), not ad-hoc SVG chevrons.

## Composition — Required (high-frequency)

Same as [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) Composition section — apply before generating screens:

- Page composition: answer pre-layout questions in `design-language/semantics/page-composition.md`; match anatomy in `design-language/patterns/screen-layout-patterns.md` (01–11); do not default to a full-width Card stack; **most content blocks ≤720px** — use columns when Main is wider. Demos: workspace-dashboard, analytics-overview, settings-form, narrow-form, settings-nav-panel, data-workflow-table
- StatisticCards: horizontal row, gap 16 or 24 — `design-language/ontology/statistic-card.md`
- No SearchInput in PageHeaderActions / Header trailing — `design-language/ontology/page-header.md`
- Main section gap: prefer MainStack (gap 24); FAIL: gap-3/gap-5/space-y-2 — `design-language/semantics/appshell-main-containment.md`
- Form fields: prefer stacked; `md:grid-cols-2` only for related pairs (first/last name) or dense forms — `design-language/patterns/forms.md`
- Required: short regions share a row at lg+ (`lg:grid-cols-2` / chart+aside); FAIL: skinny full-width list/feed/callout — `ai/examples/workspace-dashboard.tsx`
- Boxed padding: Card+CardContent (16px); FAIL: flush on box edge — `design-language/ontology/card.md`
- Tabs: prefer variant line; prefer fill={false} (condensed triggers; list still w-full); **Required:** 24px between TabsList and next item — `design-language/ontology/tabs.md`
- Table cells: body py 8px; horizontal 4px; first/last 16–24; TableHead ≥48px; compact/sm controls in rows; trailing actions → last cell `w-0` (hug) — `design-language/ontology/table-list.md`
- Status: prefer appearance outlined; colors/appearances match Badge (subtle/pastel/outlined/solid) — `design-language/ontology/status.md`
- Badge: hug label content; FAIL IF full-width of container — `design-language/ontology/badge.md`
- Feedback colors: error → destructive; warning → warning; success → constructive; info → action/info — `design-language/foundations/color.md`
- Dominant variant: keep the prevalent component variant unless the problem requires a change — `design-language/semantics/dominant-variant.md`
- Grid peers: match heights (esp. non-bottom rows); stretch if Δ ≤ 150px; bottom row may stay natural; FAIL stretch voids >150px empty — `design-language/foundations/grid.md`
- Headline hierarchy (Required): only PageHeaderTitle is 28; sections ≤24; Sheet/Drawer titles 16 — FAIL if any other headline ≥ page title — `design-language/semantics/hierarchy.md`
- PageHeader → first content ≤ 24px — `design-language/ontology/page-header.md`
- MainContent: keep `edge` or `fixed` consistent across the app; fixed: no outer L/R pad, no min-height; inner 1000 padding via appearance default|expanded (24|48) — `design-language/semantics/appshell-main-containment.md`
- PageHeaderActions / FilterbarActions: one primary; default size; >3 → DotsThree last, weight bold (not fill); prefer no Badge in PageHeaderActions — `design-language/semantics/toolbar-action-slots.md`
- Filterbar SearchInput: gray parent → surface="primary"; white parent → surface="secondary" (default); Filters: icon-only size="icon" after search — `design-language/ontology/filterbar.md`
- Medallion: prefer lg — `design-language/ontology/medallion.md`
- Icon-only Buttons: square; size="icon" (44) — `design-language/semantics/button-icon-size.md`
- Stacked bars: touching ends radius 0 — `design-language/semantics/stacked-bar-radius.md`
- Listview: width **320–480px** (`listviewWidth`, default 320); `Toolbar` titlebar; SearchInput **Required 4px** pad all sides + `border-b` on wrapper; entities `Item`/`Card`; FAIL custom header, flush SearchInput, or ad-hoc rows — `design-language/semantics/listview-drives-main.md`
- Card clip / stretch voids: FAIL clipped copy; FAIL stretch empty interiors >150px — `design-language/composition/overflow.md`, `foundations/grid.md`

Consumer AI bootstrap (Cursor / Claude / generic): `ai/guides/consumer-ai-bootstrap.md`.

## Figma (when using MCP / use_figma)

Follow [`figma.component.rules.md`](./figma.component.rules.md): in-place updates, variable-bound padding/gap/radius/strokes, local text styles, TEXT component properties for editable copy.

Inventory: `ai/figma-component-manifest.json`, props map: `ai/figma-component-props.json`.
